From 930818f56002c39118c976993885344a2db5624d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mechanyaa-ai <mechanyaa@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:29:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cps2w: the vsavjw catalogue entry re-pointed to merged-m25
 (14z-220)

jtframe's .rom builder locates every zip member by CRC32 and by nothing else
(mra2rom.go:163-172, no name fallback), so the machine entry must name the
CRCs of the actual build or the MRA produces no .rom at all. Regenerated from
build/m3b_merged33/rompath/vsavjw.zip by tools/gen_vsavjw_xml.py in the
consuming tree; --check now reports the catalogue matches the build.

EIGHT members moved, and they are the M25 member delta exactly (the consuming
tree's build/agent220/m25/member_delta.txt):
  vm3j.03d  37c76a62 -> 91261273   program: pointers into placed space
                                   relocated by #356's and #345 A1b's
                                   allocations
  vm3j.04d  21a3cfc1 -> 825d1807   program: Donovan's two calls into the
                                   speed-line copy's spawner and his
                                   class-0x72 table operand; pointer rows
                                   into placed space, relocated
  vm3j.07b  da600dff -> ec0ded7a   program: pointer rows into placed space,
                                   relocated
  vm3j.10b  6330edd6 -> e7e2cc04   likewise
  vsw.41    3b66ac7e -> 4d35a3ce   wide extension: #356's speed-line copy and
                                   #345 A1b's table copy, and the placed
                                   regions after them, moved
  vsw.42    bd9e86ff -> 6a6d3439   likewise (the relocated walker gains row
                                   124)
  vsw.33m   87fe1e0c -> 3cbf91c8   group-C glyphs, the M24 -> M25 mark
  vsw.37m   771c5dd9 -> 75b8f94d   likewise

No RTL, no cfg, no core change: doc/mame.xml only. cores/cps1, cores/cps2 and
cores/cps15 remain byte-untouched.
